 out how to socialize in her  new environment both Katie and Dora have  a run-in with a big yellow school bus  and they both understand that on  Wednesdays we wear pink  Dora for sure has some Cady heron vibes  in her film mystery solving teenagers  when you think of mystery solving teens  who started out as cartoon characters  you can't forget the og crew from the  iconic TV show  scooby Doo kids followed Fred Velma  Daphne Shaggy and Scooby every Saturday  morning as they rolled around in their  Mystery Machine and follow clues to find  out who was behind the haunting of an  amusement park spoiler it was always a  wealthy character who says the same line  like Dora and her friends the Scooby  squad always found themselves to be  smarter than the adults who were trying  to trick them and both crews have an  animal sidekick  there's Dora's friend boots and of  course the lovable but easily scared dog  scooby-doo just like Dora a live-action  version of the classic scooby-doo  cartoon was made  Scooby and boots are both CGI animals  who interacts with their human  counterparts and like Dora the Scooby  crew must travel to an island jungle to  solve a mystery they are  teamed up with an easily panicked friend  in the scooby film the skittish  character is Scooby's best friend shaggy  in Dora's movie it's their clumsy guide  who helps find her parents  both films have their share of funny  moments Dora's movie mirrors the bright  colors goofy moments and wacky ventures  of Scooby Doo  and they're even wearing the same outfit  as they did all those years ago in the  cartoons you think that door would have  updated her wardrobe by the time she got  to high school Jumanji  let's see if you can tell which movie we  are talking about Dora or Jumanji from  the synopsis a group of high school kids  are drawn to an adventure in the jungle  they must survive the harsh realities of  the jungle and go on the most dangerous  adventure of their lives they must work  together to dis